---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy & Security Guarantee — JSONCompareOnline Zero-Server Proof"
  description="Learn how JSONCompareOnline runs 100% in your local browser using Web Workers. No logs, no telemetry, no remote storage."
  activeTab="privacy"
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#f5f5f5] dark:bg-[#16181d] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#007d48] dark:text-[#34d399] mb-3 border border-[#cacacb]/40 dark:border-[#272a30]">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#007d48] dark:bg-[#34d399]"></span>
        Client-Side Privacy Architecture
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2] uppercase">
        PRIVACY & SECURITY GUARANTEE
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#4b4b4d] dark:text-[#9ca3af]">
        Why you can safely compare production API credentials, JWTs, user records, and sensitive JSON on JSONCompareOnline.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-[#39393b] dark:text-[#b5b5b8] leading-relaxed">
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f5f5f5] dark:bg-[#14161b] border border-[#e5e5e5] dark:border-[#22242a]">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2] mb-2">
          1. 100% In-Browser Execution (Zero Remote Processing)
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#4b4b4d] dark:text-[#9ca3af] leading-relaxed">
          Unlike legacy diff tools that send your text to an API server or third-party cloud container to compute differences, JSONCompareOnline runs the entire parser, Myers LCS algorithm, and RFC 6902 patch generator inside your browser session using JavaScript Web Workers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f5f5f5] dark:bg-[#14161b] border border-[#e5e5e5] dark:border-[#22242a]">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2] mb-2">
          2. How You Can Verify This Yourself
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#4b4b4d] dark:text-[#9ca3af] leading-relaxed mb-3">
          We encourage every security team and engineer to verify our privacy architecture independently:
        </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal list-inside text-xs text-[#4b4b4d] dark:text-[#9ca3af] space-y-1.5">
          <li>Open your browser Developer Tools (<kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white dark:bg-[#1a1c23] border border-[#cacacb] dark:border-[#2b2d35] text-[10px] font-mono text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2]">F12</kbd> or <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-white dark:bg-[#1a1c23] border border-[#cacacb] dark:border-[#2b2d35] text-[10px] font-mono text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2]">Cmd+Option+I</kbd>).</li>
          <li>Navigate to the <strong>Network</strong> tab.</li>
          <li>Paste any JSON payload into the left and right comparison panels and run a diff.</li>
          <li>Observe that <strong>zero HTTP POST/PUT requests</strong> are dispatched.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f5f5f5] dark:bg-[#14161b] border border-[#e5e5e5] dark:border-[#22242a]">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2] mb-2">
          3. No Cookies, No Trackers, No Fingerprinting
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#4b4b4d] dark:text-[#9ca3af] leading-relaxed">
          We do not store cookies on your device, use third-party behavioral trackers, or save state to remote databases. When you close or refresh the tab, your JSON data is completely wiped from browser memory.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
